# The bytes of a tool group (T8): two steps of read-only calls that the
# group's block rewrites in place as each one starts and finishes, then the
# answer under it, then the wire -- whether each rewrite of the group's rows
# is inside the update that paints the band under them.
gateway toolgroup-wire-turns.json
work toolgroup-ws
wait 2
type read the files
key Enter
wait 4
snap end
snapfull end
wire end
